    "https://www.careers.hrp.gov.sg/sap/bc/ui5_ui5/sap/ZGERCFA004/index.html?search-keyword=temasek#/JobDescription/16246210/005056a3-53e2-1fd1-a8ca-9d7615463406": {
      "title": "Adjunct Lecturer (Veterinary Technology / Veterinary Wellness Care)",
      "description": "Closing Date: 30/12/2026 Find A Job | Careers@Gov Emphasized Available Values Footer actions skip to content Home Find A Job/ Internship FAQ CONTACT US LOGIN LOG OUT menu-button search-button Adjunct Lecturer (Veterinary Technology / Veterinary Wellness Care) Temasek Polytechnic 02-05 year(s) Contract, Part-time Closing on 30 Dec 2026 0 Applicant(s) APPLY NOW What the role is Adjunct Lecturer (Veterinary Technology / Veterinary Wellness Care) What you will be working on Temasek Polytechnic is seeking experienced and passionate professionals to join our team as Adjunct Lecturers in the part-time Diploma in Applied Science (Veterinary Technology) and Specialist Diploma in Veterinary Wellness Care courses to teach one or more of the following subject areas: Subject Areas and Teaching Periods Animal Physical Therapy and Rehabilitation Animal Nutrition Herbal Medicine and Nutraceuticals in Veterinary Care Traditional Chinese Veterinary Medicine Animal Behaviour and Enrichment Clinical Veterinary Nursing Surgical Nursing and Anaesthesia Diagnostic and Laboratory Techniques Professional Practices Emergency, Medical and Surgical Nursing Key Responsibilities Deliver engaging lectures, tutorials, and practical/practicum sessions either in-person or via online platforms. Conduct classes one to two weekday evenings per week (7:00 PM – 10:00 PM) OR Saturdays (before 6:00 PM) within the specified teaching period. Facilitate synchronous lectures, tutorials and practical sessions, as well as asynchronous e-learning and self-directed learning, by preparing lesson materials, recording lectures, and creating online assessments. Design, develop, and review subject content, including setting and marking of assessments and ensuring timely entry of assessment results. Provide academic guidance and support to students related to the subject matter. Participate in subject review discussions with the designated Subject Leader at the end of the semester. What we are looking for Qualification and relevant expertise in at least one of the subject areas listed above. Minimum of 2 years of industry experience in the veterinary sector, with hands-on involvement in clinical practice, animal rehabilitation, nutrition, or wellness care. Proficient in handling and delivering veterinary care to animals, particularly companion animals and/or exotic species. Strong communication and interpersonal skills, with a genuine interest in mentoring and engaging adult learners. Demonstrated ability to facilitate learning, with experience in adult education, training delivery, or instructional design for workshops or courses considered an advantage. Experience in developing e-learning materials or using digital tools to support learning will be an added benefit. About Temasek Polytechnic Established in 1990, Temasek Polytechnic (TP) is a leading institution of high learning nestled by the idyllic shores of Bedok Reservoir in Tampines.  TP takes pride in equipping our students with lifelong skills and digital knowledge for a future of dynamic change.\n\nTP’s caring and vibrant culture is firmly rooted in our core values which drive a spirit of innovation, with a focus on industry, globalization and sustainability.  “TP Cares” is our clarion call to ensure that our diverse community of learners has the opportunity to achieve their personal best, so that they can contribute meaningfully to the global community.\n\nLearner. Creator. Leader\nWe envision the TP graduate as a values-led leader with vision, character and heart, excelling in the academic domain and beyond, and rising to the challenge of creating tomorrow. You might also be interested in Lecturer (Integrated & Smart Facility Management) / School of Engineer Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer (Information Technology) / School of Informatics & IT Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer/Senior Lecturer (Sustainability Finance) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Dec 9999 Lecturer (Architectural Technology & Building Services) / School of En Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Oct 2026 Lecturer (Aviation Management) / School of Engineering Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Nov 2026 Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Veterinary Technology) Temasek Polytechnic Closing in 6  day(s) Senior Lecturer/Lecturer (HR Tech, Analytics, AI in HR) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Language and Communication Lecturer (Polytechnic Foundation Programme) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 22 Oct 2026 Adjunct Lecturer (Veterinary Technology / Veterinary Wellness Care) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Dec 2026 APPLY NOW"
