    "https://www.careers.hrp.gov.sg/sap/bc/ui5_ui5/sap/ZGERCFA004/index.html?search-keyword=temasek#/JobDescription/17042710/005056a3-53e2-1fd0-bea1-425e32b493e4": {
      "title": "Lecturer/Senior Lecturer (Sustainability Finance)",
      "description": "Closing Date: 29/12/2026 Find A Job | Careers@Gov Emphasized Available Values Footer actions skip to content Home Find A Job/ Internship FAQ CONTACT US LOGIN LOG OUT menu-button search-button Lecturer/Senior Lecturer (Sustainability Finance) Temasek Polytechnic 03-05 year(s) Fixed Terms, Full-time 0 Applicant(s) APPLY NOW What the role is We are looking for a highly motivated and skilled individual to join the School of Business. What you will be working on The successful candidate is expected to fulfil the following responsibilities, mainly: Distil the knowledge and skills required for sustainability finance into stackable teaching units for PET and CET training. Develop teaching and assessment curriculum and course materials for PET and CET learners, to drive teaching excellence. Conduct PET classes and CET training, in accordance to teaching quality standard of TP. Collaborate with industry to provide industry linkages to the teaching curriculum. Engage with industry projects/workgroups. Lead and/or actively contribute to school activities, poly-based committees and/or inter-poly activities. Lead, mentor and coach students, in school curriculum, school activities and/or interest groups/student groups. Organise and administer student-related/school activities such as learning journeys, and student trips. Teach business school subjects in conjunction with sustainable finance subjects. What we are looking for Tertiary qualification in finance, banking, investment, asset management, business, economics and/or sustainability. Advanced degrees or certifications in sustainability are a plus. Working experience in sustainable/green finance, sustainability management or corporate sustainability in local contexts is preferred. Experience in climate change management, carbon markets, transition plans, decarbonisation strategies management and/or impact indicators reporting. Strong communicator and possess the ability to collaborate with others to drive positive learning outcomes. Has a growth mindset to stay abreast of industry developments. Good administrative skills with strong ability to multi-task. Digitally savvy and able to leverage digital tools for teaching. Passion in coaching, mentoring, and guiding students. About Temasek Polytechnic Established in 1990, Temasek Polytechnic (TP) is a leading institution of high learning nestled by the idyllic shores of Bedok Reservoir in Tampines.  TP takes pride in equipping our students with lifelong skills and digital knowledge for a future of dynamic change.\n\nTP’s caring and vibrant culture is firmly rooted in our core values which drive a spirit of innovation, with a focus on industry, globalization and sustainability.  “TP Cares” is our clarion call to ensure that our diverse community of learners has the opportunity to achieve their personal best, so that they can contribute meaningfully to the global community.\n\nLearner. Creator. Leader\nWe envision the TP graduate as a values-led leader with vision, character and heart, excelling in the academic domain and beyond, and rising to the challenge of creating tomorrow. You might also be interested in Lecturer (Integrated & Smart Facility Management) / School of Engineer Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer (Information Technology) / School of Informatics & IT Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer (Architectural Technology & Building Services) / School of En Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Oct 2026 Lecturer (Aviation Management) / School of Engineering Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Nov 2026 Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Veterinary Technology) Temasek Polytechnic Closing in 6  day(s) Senior Lecturer/Lecturer (HR Tech, Analytics, AI in HR) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Language and Communication Lecturer (Polytechnic Foundation Programme) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 22 Oct 2026 Senior/Engineer (Healthcare Engineering Center) / School of Engineerin Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Dec 2026 Lecturer/Senior Lecturer (Sustainability Finance) Temasek Polytechnic APPLY NOW"
