    "https://www.careers.hrp.gov.sg/sap/bc/ui5_ui5/sap/ZGERCFA004/index.html?search-keyword=temasek#/JobDescription/17956367/005056a3-53e2-1fd1-a6cf-2a7447c2d402": {
      "title": "Lecturer (Applied Artificial Intelligence) / School of Informatics & IT",
      "description": "Closing Date: 29/11/2026 Find A Job | Careers@Gov Emphasized Available Values Footer actions skip to content Home Find A Job/ Internship FAQ CONTACT US LOGIN LOG OUT menu-button search-button Lecturer (Applied Artificial Intelligence) / School of Informatics & IT Temasek Polytechnic 03-06 year(s) Fixed Terms, Full-time Closing on 29 Nov 2026 0 Applicant(s) APPLY NOW What the role is Lecturer (Applied Artificial Intelligence) / School of Informatics & IT What you will be working on Deliver lessons in both face-to-face and online formats for full-time and/or part-time courses. Design, develop, and update teaching materials and assessments, with a focus on practical applications of Computer Vision such as image processing, object detection, facial recognition, and video analytics. Supervise student projects and foster independent learning in areas including deep learning for vision, visual recognition systems, and multi-modal AI. Evaluate student assignments and academic performance, providing constructive feedback to support learning outcomes. Mentor and coach students to enhance their academic and professional development. Stay informed about the latest trends and advancements in Computer Vision, Machine Learning, and Artificial Intelligence. Collaborate with colleagues and industry partners on AI and Computer Vision-related projects, contributing to applied research and innovation. What we are looking for Possess relevant academic qualifications in Computer Science, Software Engineering, Artificial Intelligence, or a related discipline. Minimum of 2 years of professional experience in application development and/or Artificial Intelligence, with demonstrated expertise in Computer Vision, including: image and video analysis, pattern recognition, and visual perception tasks. Hands-on experience with deep learning frameworks such as TensorFlow, PyTorch, or Keras, applied to vision models (e.g., convolutional neural networks, object detection, image segmentation). Proficiency with open-source Computer Vision libraries such as OpenCV or equivalent. Skilled in at least two programming languages (e.g., Python, Java, C#, JavaScript), with strong proficiency in Python preferred. Passionate about sharing knowledge and engaging with both youth and adult learners. Excellent communication and interpersonal skills. A collaborative team player with the ability to work effectively with colleagues and industry partners. About Temasek Polytechnic Established in 1990, Temasek Polytechnic (TP) is a leading institution of high learning nestled by the idyllic shores of Bedok Reservoir in Tampines.  TP takes pride in equipping our students with lifelong skills and digital knowledge for a future of dynamic change.\n\nTP’s caring and vibrant culture is firmly rooted in our core values which drive a spirit of innovation, with a focus on industry, globalization and sustainability.  “TP Cares” is our clarion call to ensure that our diverse community of learners has the opportunity to achieve their personal best, so that they can contribute meaningfully to the global community.\n\nLearner. Creator. Leader\nWe envision the TP graduate as a values-led leader with vision, character and heart, excelling in the academic domain and beyond, and rising to the challenge of creating tomorrow. You might also be interested in Senior Manager (Platforms & Automation) / IT & Services Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Nov 2026 Lecturer (Big Data Analytics) / School of Informatics & IT Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Head, Cyber Threat Intelligence, Tech Ops, xCyber HTX Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Lead Engineer/Engineer, Security-By-Design, CISO Office, xCyber HTX Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Deputy Director, AI R&D (LLM & Multimodal AI), Q Team CoE HTX Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Lead Engineer / Engineer (Product Management), Content Platform, xDigi HTX Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Lead Engineer / Engineer, AI Agent Engineer, Programme Planning Office HTX Closi