d student development. Ability to work independently and collaboratively in cross-functional settings. Adaptable and versatile, with the ability to respond to changing operational and educational needs. Experience in airport or air traffic simulation is preferred. About Temasek Polytechnic Established in 1990, Temasek Polytechnic (TP) is a leading institution of high learning nestled by the idyllic shores of Bedok Reservoir in Tampines.  TP takes pride in equipping our students with lifelong skills and digital knowledge for a future of dynamic change.\n\nTP’s caring and vibrant culture is firmly rooted in our core values which drive a spirit of innovation, with a focus on industry, globalization and sustainability.  “TP Cares” is our clarion call to ensure that our diverse community of learners has the opportunity to achieve their personal best, so that they can contribute meaningfully to the global community.\n\nLearner. Creator. Leader\nWe envision the TP graduate as a values-led leader with vision, character and heart, excelling in the academic domain and beyond, and rising to the challenge of creating tomorrow. You might also be interested in Lecturer (Integrated & Smart Facility Management) / School of Engineer Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer (Information Technology) / School of Informatics & IT Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer/Senior Lecturer (Sustainability Finance) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Dec 9999 Lecturer (Architectural Technology & Building Services) / School of En Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Oct 2026 Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Veterinary Technology) Temasek Polytechnic Closing in 6  day(s) Senior Lecturer/Lecturer (HR Tech, Analytics, AI in HR) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Language and Communication Lecturer (Polytechnic Foundation Programme) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 22 Oct 2026 Senior/Engineer (Healthcare Engineering Center) / School of Engineerin Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 3