    "https://www.careers.hrp.gov.sg/sap/bc/ui5_ui5/sap/ZGERCFA004/index.html?search-keyword=temasek#/JobDescription/18071376/005056a3-d347-1fe1-ad89-0fb8b4ec82be": {
      "title": "Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Veterinary Technology)",
      "description": "Closing Date: 29/12/2026 Find A Job | Careers@Gov Emphasized Available Values Footer actions skip to content Home Find A Job/ Internship FAQ CONTACT US LOGIN LOG OUT menu-button search-button Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Veterinary Technology) Temasek Polytechnic 03-08 year(s) Fixed Terms, Full-time Closing in 6  day(s) 0 Applicant(s) APPLY NOW What the role is Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Veterinary Technology) What you will be working on Design, develop, review, and deliver Continuing Education and Training (CET) programmes (both full qualifications and short courses) in veterinary–related disciplines such as animal care, veterinary nursing, animal behaviour and training. Develop training materials, including lesson plans, slides, assessments, and practical guides Identify emerging industry trends and opportunities to develop new CET courses and programmes Adopt innovative and learner-centric teaching methodologies, including blended and experiential learning approaches Design and develop e-learning content, including microlearning modules Monitor and evaluate course satisfaction and performance Implement improvements to enhance learning outcomes and participant experience Coordinate pre-semester planning, including timetabling, resource allocation, and course setup Support course promotion activities What we are looking for Qualification in veterinary technology/veterinary nursing or its equivalent from recognised institutions. At least 3 to 8 years of relevant industrial experience in a vet clinic/animal hospital. Familiar with ‘Day One Competences’ for Veterinary Nurses. Have a passion for developing talents, and genuine interest to share knowledge and interact with youths and adult learners. Resourceful and able to work independently to meet deadlines and perform well under pressure. Strong communication and interpersonal skills. Demonstrated capacity to work within a team. Able to work in the evenings for night classes About Temasek Polytechnic Established in 1990, Temasek Polytechnic (TP) is a leading institution of high learning nestled by the idyllic shores of Bedok Reservoir in Tampines.  TP takes pride in equipping our students with lifelong skills and digital knowledge for a future of dynamic change.\n\nTP’s caring and vibrant culture is firmly rooted in our core values which drive a spirit of innovation, with a focus on industry, globalization and sustainability.  “TP Cares” is our clarion call to ensure that our diverse community of learners has the opportunity to achieve their personal best, so that they can contribute meaningfully to the global community.\n\nLearner. Creator. Leader\nWe envision the TP graduate as a values-led leader with vision, character and heart, excelling in the academic domain and beyond, and rising to the challenge of creating tomorrow. You might also be interested in Lecturer (Integrated & Smart Facility Management) / School of Engineer Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer (Information Technology) / School of Informatics & IT Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Dec 2026 Lecturer/Senior Lecturer (Sustainability Finance) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Dec 9999 Lecturer (Architectural Technology & Building Services) / School of En Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Oct 2026 Lecturer (Aviation Management) / School of Engineering Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 29 Nov 2026 Senior Lecturer/Lecturer (HR Tech, Analytics, AI in HR) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 16 Oct 2026 Language and Communication Lecturer (Polytechnic Foundation Programme) Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 22 Oct 2026 Senior/Engineer (Healthcare Engineering Center) / School of Engineerin Temasek Polytechnic Closing on 30 Dec 2026 Lecturer / Senior Lecturer (Veterinary Technology) Temasek Polytechnic Closing in 6  day(s) APPLY NOW"
